/T (The HCPS Dual language Immersion program utilizes strategies and resources to facilitate language Acquisition.  Researchers such as Cummins, Snow, Filmore, and Krashen have come to the general conciseness that it takes 5-7 years of immersion for students to become biliterate in a second language. The full student benefits are only evident over the long-term enrollment in the program.)
/E (The HCPS Dual language Immersion program utilizes strategies and resources to facilitate language Acquisition.  Researchers such as Cummins, Snow, Filmore, and Krashen have come to the general conciseness that it takes 5-7 years of immersion for students to become biliterate in a second language. The full student benefits are only evident over the long-term enrollment in the program.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
